1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:10,666
Today we are going to find C and F.

3
00:00:12,966 --> 00:00:16,842
Piano keys are named
with just seven letters.

4
00:00:17,542 --> 00:00:18,549
A

5
00:00:18,599 --> 00:00:19,700
B

6
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:20,850
C

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,093
D

8
00:00:22,143 --> 00:00:23,118
E

9
00:00:23,168 --> 00:00:24,314
F

10
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:25,564
G

11
00:00:27,661 --> 00:00:31,305
Look at this group of two black keys.

12
00:00:32,005 --> 00:00:35,509
The white key just below… is C.

13
00:00:36,209 --> 00:00:37,409
C

14
00:00:39,659 --> 00:00:44,510
Every group of two has a
C sitting just below it.

15
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:52,008
Now look at a group
of three black keys.

16
00:00:52,708 --> 00:00:56,351
The white key just below… is F.

17
00:00:57,051 --> 00:00:58,251
F

18
00:01:00,548 --> 00:01:05,213
Every group of three has
an F sitting just below it.

19
00:01:09,313 --> 00:01:16,440
Just below two is C.
Just below three is F.

20
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:21,340
C

21
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:23,090
F

22
00:01:23,687 --> 00:01:24,887
C

23
00:01:25,437 --> 00:01:26,637
F

24
00:01:29,433 --> 00:01:32,009
Your turn! Where is C?

25
00:01:37,109 --> 00:01:38,309
C

26
00:01:40,659 --> 00:01:41,934
Where is F?

27
00:01:46,634 --> 00:01:47,834
F

28
00:01:50,231 --> 00:01:51,645
Where is C?

29
00:01:56,345 --> 00:01:57,545
C

30
00:01:57,896 --> 00:01:59,217
You've got it!

31
00:02:00,917 --> 00:02:02,378
Now it's your turn!

32
00:02:02,478 --> 00:02:06,586
Play C Hunt, and find C and F!

33
00:02:06,686 --> 00:02:09,076
See you for the next Nugget!

